     <DIV class=WordSection1 style="LAYOUT-GRID:  15.6pt none">
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>绍兴市教育教学研究院关于举行</SPAN></B><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 方正小标宋简体"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>绍兴市第四届</SPAN></B><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 方正小标宋简体">“</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>精品课程群</SPAN></B><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 方正小标宋简体">”</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 方正小标宋简体; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>征集评选活动的通知</SPAN></B><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 方正小标宋简体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #333333; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>各区、县（市）教研室（教师发展中心、教育研究中心）：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>为了进一步推进学校课程建设，积极引导学校加强课程建设的系统性和逻辑性思考，避免学校课程开发与实施的碎片化和拼盘式现象。经研究，决定举行绍兴市第四届</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">“</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>精品课程群</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">”</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>征集评选活动。现将有关事项通知如下：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>一、征集内容</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #333333; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 微软雅黑"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>课程群是指为完善学生的素养结构，围绕同一学科或主题（领域），将与该学科或主题（领域）具有逻辑联系的若干课程在目标、内容、实施方式、评价等方面进行重新规划、整合构建而成的有机的课程系统。本次征集评选活动面向小学、初中和高中，征集各校自主开发的、供学生选择性修习的优质课程群。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #333333; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 微软雅黑"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>二、申报条件</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #333333; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 微软雅黑"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">1.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>关联性。课程群一般应由同一学科或同一主题（领域）的</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">3</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>门及以上系列课程组成，课程之间联系紧密，内在逻辑性强。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">2.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>整合性。课程群不同课程之间应围绕一定主线作恰当的串联，将课程内容进行优化整合，体现群内一门课程对另一门课程的意义。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">3.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>示范性。课程群主干课程须有</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">2</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>年以上实施期，每年都有学生选修该课程群中的相关课程，目前仍在开设，且群内至少有</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>门课程曾入选区、县（市）级以上精品课程。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">4.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>原创性。课程群须由学校自主开发，有完整的课程纲要、教学材料和实施方案，课程目标设计科学，内容编排合理，实施规范有序，保障体系完备，课程管理到位，注重学生学习方式的改进及学习经历的丰富。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=left><B><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-font-kerning: 0pt'>三、申报程序与要求</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; COLOR: #333333; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 微软雅黑"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">1.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>学校提出申报，区、县（市）教研室组织初审，择优逐级推荐。市直高中向绍兴市教育教学研究院提出申报。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">2.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>在各单位推荐的基础上，市研究院将组织专家进行评审。评审结果在研究院网站上公示一周。如有问题，则取消评审资格。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">3.</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>各地推荐课程群须报送材料包括：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 29pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）绍兴市精品课程群申报表（见附件</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: "Times New Roman"'>）；</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
